      "image": "assets/images/31096/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rub chops with 2 teaspoons seasoning salt and 1 teaspoon pepper, or to taste.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NKlmKmsFdOy5Ze-Zitk1cTmUuE8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-31096-easy-caramelized-onion-pork-chops-VAT-step-02-52b00964a85d4d90aa223f86c75a0650.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/31096/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a skillet, heat oil over medium heat. Brown pork chops on each side. Add the onions and water to the pan. Cover, reduce heat, and simmer for 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ftkrp8FiFbuiNXFC2FDo7tajubE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-31096-easy-caramelized-onion-pork-chops-VAT-step-03-2-0290f81b69164a198831581e5babd4a8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/31096/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn chops over, and add remaining salt and pepper. Cover, and cook until water evaporates and onions turn light to medium brown.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iU7mX9UUo0W5sU5Xqzi65ZMCQf8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-31096-easy-caramelized-onion-pork-chops-VAT-step-04-1-a03442c3bc4b45eaa02621771797ab9e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/31096/step_04.webp"
